    "project": "CoopGuard: Multi-Modal IoT Sensor Mesh and Predictive Edge-AI Android Dashboard Engine for Precision Poultry Welfare",
    "description": "CoopGuard addresses lethal operational delays in tropical poultry production by deploying a multi-modal IoT sensor mesh paired with a localized Edge-AI engine and offline-capable Android telemetry dashboard. Developed at Naga College Foundation Inc., the system continuous-samples ambient parameters across 4 coop quadrants and processes 16 kHz bioacoustic streams via quantized tinyML neural networks on a Raspberry Pi 5 node in under 45 ms. Supported by initial grant funding of ₱80,000 from the Department of Agriculture Young Farmers Challenge (YFC), CoopGuard is currently in Prototype Development and scheduled for Pilot Testing by the end of November 2026. Manufactured at a COGS of ₱12,662.00 and retailed at ₱15,000.00 with a ₱999 /month SaaS fee, CoopGuard delivers a 158% net cycle ROI by cutting flock mortality below 2% and saving farmers ₱39,600.00 to ₱45,000.00 per 5,000-bird grow cycle."
